expression: text
---
Recent requests of your devices (last 48 hours), with the reason when one was
rejected. Without SENSOR: all devices you manage.

Usage: hn console [OPTIONS] [SENSOR]

Arguments:
  [SENSOR]  Sensor id, default all devices you manage

Options:
  -f, --follow         Keep printing new lines
      --rejected       Only rejected requests
  -n, --limit <LIMIT>  Number of lines (1 to 200) [default: 30]
  -h, --help           Print help

Global options:
  -p, --profile <NAME>  Profile to use (server and login), see 'hn profile list'
      --json            Print JSON instead of tables (stable shape, for scripts)

Examples:
  hn console
  hn console <sensor-id> -f
  hn console --rejected
